OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers killed in crash
OL,4,Anear Middlesbrough remembered as
OL,5,A'fun-loving' and 'kind'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo police officers killed in a car
OL,8,Fcrash on the A66 near Middlesbrough on
OL,9,FSaturday have been hailed as heroes by
OL,10,Ffamily members
OL,12,FPC Tom Clough, 38, and PC Matthew
OL,13,FBlades, 37, died when a Volkswagen
OL,14,FPassat, travelling the wrong way along
OL,15,Fthe road, collided with their marked
OL,16,Fpolice car
OL,18,FIn tributes released by Cleveland
OL,19,FPolice yesterday, Clough's family say
OL,20,Fhe was "willing to help anyone" while
OL,21,FBlades' wife describes him as "loved
OL,22,Fbeyond words"
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
